      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you clarify exactly what you have changed in the CL ?\n\nall the GPIO flags seem the same before and after the CL unless I miss a change.\nThe only change I\u0027m seeing is removing the gpio_set_level and putting the level flag in the gpio_set_flags which is just re-ordering the operations.\nOrder is important as mentioned below, but I\u0027m not sure how this would fix it unless the npc5x has yet another weird behavior in its GPIO registers.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 10,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "7453f95132a979f769f8c44f3c33e2851dd8c288",
