      "writtenOn": "2016-12-09T18:32:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we set the level in a subsequent function call, there is a brief period of time where the pad will be configured as outout, but the output level will reflect whatever we previously set (we won\u0027t reconfigure output level unless GPIO_HIGH / GPIO_LOW is passed to gpio_set_flags). If this is the bug we\u0027re fixing here then it makes sense to me, but I agree we should clarify this in the commit message.",
